# WalletKit review policy.
#
# `main` and `v25` require zero approving reviews with "require review from code
# owners" enabled, so a review is only required for the paths below. Everything
# else relies on `.github/workflows/small-change-gate.yml`, which requires a
# review once a change exceeds 500 lines.
#
# Keep this list narrow, and give every pattern owners: a pattern without owners
# is not a way to unset ownership, it just owns nothing.
# A wildcard owner gates every pull request, and bypassing it then becomes the
# normal way to merge.

# CI, repo configuration and automation
